# Input

```svelte
<div>
  <span>before text</span> 
  text
</div>
<div>
  <span>before element</span> 

  <strong>after blank line</strong>
</div>
<svg>
  <defs /> 

  <g></g>
</svg>
<div>
  <span>before comment</span> 

  <!-- grouped comment -->
</div>

<div><span>before text</span> 
text</div>
<div><span>before element</span> 

<strong>after blank line</strong></div>
<svg><defs /> 

<g></g></svg>
<div><span>before comment</span> 

<!-- grouped comment --></div>

```


# Formatted

```svelte
<div>
	<span>before text</span>
	text
</div>
<div>
	<span>before element</span>

	<strong>after blank line</strong>
</div>
<svg>
	<defs />

	<g></g>
</svg>
<div>
	<span>before comment</span>

	<!-- grouped comment -->
</div>

<div><span>before text</span> text</div>
<div>
	<span>before element</span>

	<strong>after blank line</strong>
</div>
<svg>
	<defs />

	<g></g>
</svg>
<div>
	<span>before comment</span>

	<!-- grouped comment -->
</div>

```
